{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"南面","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"契丹國自唐太宗置都督、刺史，武后加以王封，玄宗置經略使，始有唐官爵矣。其後習聞河北藩鎮受唐官名，於是太師、太保、司徒、司空施于部族。太祖因之。大同元年，世宗始置北院樞密使。明年，世宗以高勳為南院樞密。則樞密之設，蓋自太宗入汴始矣。天祿四年，建政事省。於是南面官僚可得而書。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"其始，漢人樞密院兼尚書省，吏、兵刑有承旨，戶、工有主事，中書省兼禮部，別有戶部使司。以營州之地加幽、冀之半，用是適足矣。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中葉彌文，耶律楊六為太傅，知有三師矣。忽古質為太尉，知有三公矣。於斡古得為常侍，劉涇為禮部尚書，知有門下、尚書省矣。庫部、虞部、倉部員外出使，則知備郎官列宿之員。室昉監修，則知國史有院。程翥舍人，則知起居有注。邢抱朴承旨，王言敷學士，則知有翰林內制。張幹政事舍人，則知有中書外制。大理、司農有卿，國子、少府有監，九卿、列監見矣。金吾、千牛有大將，十六列衛見矣。太子上有師保，下有府率，東宮備官也。節度、觀察、防禦、團練、刺史，咸在方州，如唐制也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"凡唐官可考見者，列具于篇；無徵者不書。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"南面朝官","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"遼有北面朝官矣，既得燕、代十有六州，乃用唐制，復設南面三省、六部、臺、院、寺、監、諸衛、東宮之官。誠有志帝王之盛制，亦以招徠中國之人也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"三師府。本名三公，漢以丞相、太尉、御史大夫為三公，故稱三師。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"太師。穆宗應曆三年見太師唐骨德。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"太傅。太宗會同元年命馮道守太傅。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"太保。會同元年劉昫守太保。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"少師。耶律資忠傳見少師蕭把哥。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"少傅。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"少保。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"掌印。耶律乙辛，重熙中掌太保印。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"三公府。先漢丞相、太尉、御史大夫，後漢更名大司徒、大司馬、大司空，唐太尉、司徒、司空，又名三司。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"太尉。太宗天顯十一年見太尉趙思溫。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"司徒。世宗天祿元年見司徒劃設。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"司空。聖宗統和三十年見司空邢抱質。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"漢人樞密院。本兵部之職，在周為大司馬，漢為太尉。唐季宦官用事，內置樞密院，後改用士人。晉天福中廢，開運元年復置。太祖初有漢兒司，韓知古總知漢兒司事。太宗入汴，因晉置樞密院，掌漢人兵馬之政，初兼尚書省。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"樞密使。太宗大同元年見樞密使李崧。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知樞密使事。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知樞密院事。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"樞密副使。楊遵勗，咸雍中為樞密副使。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"同知樞密院事。聖宗太平六年見同知樞密院事耶律迷離已。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知樞密院副使事。楊皙，興宗重熙十二年知樞密院副使事。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"樞密直學士。聖宗統和二年見樞密直學士郭嘏。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"樞密都承旨。聖宗開泰九年見樞密都承旨韓紹芳。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"樞密副承旨。楊遵勗，重熙中為樞密副承旨。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"吏房承旨。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"兵刑房承旨。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"戶房主事。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"廳房即工部主事。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中書省。初名政事省。太祖置官，世宗天祿四年建政事省，興宗重熙十三年改中書省。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中書令。韓延徽，太祖時為政事令；韓知古，天顯初為中書令；會同五年又見政事令趙延壽。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"大丞相。太宗大同元年見大丞相趙延壽。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左丞相。聖宗太平四年見左丞相張儉。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右丞相。聖宗開泰元年見右丞相馬保忠。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知中書省事。蕭孝友，興宗重熙十年知中書省事。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中書侍郎。韓資讓，壽隆初為中書侍郎。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"同中書門下平章事。太祖加王郁同政事門下平章事，太宗大同元年見平章事張礪。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"參知政事。聖宗統和十二年見參知政事邢抱朴。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"堂後官。太平二年見堂後官張克恭。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"主事。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"守當官。並見耶律儼建官制度。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"令史。耶律儼，道宗咸雍三年為中書省令史。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中書舍人院。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"中書舍人。室昉，景宗保寧間為政事舍人；道宗咸雍三年見中書舍人馬鉉。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右諫院。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右諫議大夫。聖宗統和七年見諫議大夫馬得臣。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右補闕。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右拾遺。劉景，穆宗應曆初為右拾遺。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"門下省。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"侍中。趙思忠，太宗會同中為侍中。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"常侍。興宗重熙十四年見常侍斡古得。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"散騎常侍。馬人望，天祚乾統中為左散騎常侍。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"給事中。聖宗統和二年見給事中郭嘏。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"門下侍郎。楊皙，清寧初為門下侍郎。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"起居舍人院。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"起居舍人。聖宗開泰五年見起居舍人程翥。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知起居注。耶律敵烈，重熙末知起居注。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"起居郎。杜防，開泰中為起居郎。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左諫院。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左諫議大夫。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左補闕。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左拾遺。統和三年見左拾遺劉景。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"通事舍人院。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"通事舍人。統和七年見通事舍人李琬。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"符寶司。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"符寶郎。耶律玦，重熙初為符寶郎。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"東上閤門司。太宗會同元年置。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"東上閤門使。韓延徽傳見東上閤門使鄭延豐。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"東上閤門副使。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"西上閤門司。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"西上閤門使。統和二十一年見西上閤門使丁振。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"西上閤門副使。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"東頭承奉班。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"東頭承奉官。韓德讓，景宗時為東頭承奉官。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"西頭承奉班。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"西頭承奉官。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"通進司。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左通進。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右通進。耶律瑤質，景宗時為右通進。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"登聞鼓院。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"登聞鼓使。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"匭院。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知匭院使。太平三年見知匭院事杜防。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"誥院。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"誥院給事。耶律鐸斡，重熙末為誥院給事。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚書省。太祖嘗置左右尚書。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚書令。蕭思溫，景宗保寧初為尚書令。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左僕射。太祖初康默記為左尚書，三年見左僕射韓知古。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右僕射。太宗會同元年見右僕射烈束。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左丞。武白為尚書左丞。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右丞。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左司郎中。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右司郎中。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左司員外郎。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右司員外郎。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"六部職名總目：","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部尚書。聖宗開泰元年見吏部尚書劉績。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部侍郎。王觀，興宗重熙中為兵部侍郎；李澣，穆宗朝累遷工部侍郎。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部郎中。劉輝，道宗大安末為禮部郎中。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部員外郎。開泰五年見禮部員外郎王景運。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"某部郎中。聖宗統和九年見虞部郎中崔祐。諸曹郎官未詳。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"御史臺。太宗會同元年置。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"御史大夫。會同九年見御史大夫耶律解里。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"御史中丞。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"侍御。重熙七年見南面侍御壯骨里。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"殿中司。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"殿中。聖宗開泰元年見殿中高可恒。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"殿中丞。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚舍局。見遼朝雜禮。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"奉御。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚乘局奉御。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚輦局奉御。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚食局奉御。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚衣局奉御。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林院。掌天子文翰之事。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林都林牙。興宗重熙十三年見翰林都林牙耶律庶成。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"南面林牙。耶律磨魯古，聖宗統和初為南面林牙。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林學士承旨。趙延壽傳見翰林學士承旨張礪。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林學士。太宗大同元年見和凝為翰林學士。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林祭酒。韓德崇，景宗保寧初為翰林祭酒。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知制誥。室昉，太宗入汴，詔知制誥。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林畫院。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林畫待詔。聖宗開泰七年見翰林畫待詔陳升。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"翰林醫官。天祚保大二年見提舉翰林醫官李奭。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"國史院。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"監修國史。聖宗統和九年見監修國史室昉。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"史館學士。景宗保寧八年見史館學士。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"史館修撰。劉輝，大安末為史館修撰。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"修國史。耶律玦，重熙初修國史。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"宣政殿。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"宣政殿學士。穆宗應曆元年見宣政殿學士李澣。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"觀書殿。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"觀書殿學士。王鼎，壽隆初為觀書殿學士。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"昭文館。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"昭文館直學士。楊遵勗子晦為昭文館直學士。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"崇文館。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"崇文館大學士。韓延徽，太祖時為崇文館大學士。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"乾文閣。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"乾文閣學士。王觀，道宗咸雍五年為乾文閣學士。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"宣徽院。太宗會同元年置。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"宣徽使。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"知宣徽院事。馬得臣，統和初知宣徽院事。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"宣徽副使。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"同知宣徽使事。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"同知宣徽院事。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內省。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內省使。聖宗太平九年初見內省使。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_153","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內省副使。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_154","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內藏庫。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_155","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內藏庫提點。道宗清寧元年見內藏庫提點耶律烏骨。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_156","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內侍省。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_157","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"黃門令。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_158","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內謁者。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_159","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內侍省押班。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_160","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內侍左廂押班。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_161","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內侍右廂押班。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_162","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"契丹、漢兒、渤海內侍都知。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_163","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"左承宣使。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_164","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"右承宣使。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_165","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"內庫。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_166","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"都提點內庫。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_47_167","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_47","textTraditional":"尚衣庫。","s